WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.800
A gate built in Phase 1, fed by nothing since.

2
00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:09.100
And only a description to go on.

3
00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:13.200
So the words go out once, to find companies.

4
00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:17.100
Disarmed first: a text box is a text box.

5
00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:21.400
Count agreement between questions, not volume.

6
00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:25.700
From URLs only. The gate compares these scores.

7
00:00:25.700 --> 00:00:29.000
And let each company name itself.

8
00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:32.900
The harness found a test passing by luck.

9
00:00:32.900 --> 00:00:35.400
The gate has something to gate.
